{title: Paatu Paadava}
{artist: A M Rajah Then Nilava}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm] Paattu Paada Vaa,        [A] Paarthu Pesa Vaa
[Gm] Paadam Solla Vaa,        [A] Parandhu Sella [Dm] Vaa
[Dm] Paal Nilaavai [Gm] Pola Vandha,        [A#] Paavai Alla [A] Vaa..
Naanum [A] Paadhai Thedi [Gm] Odi,        Vandha [A#] Kaalai Alla [Dm] Vaa
[Dm] Mega Vannam Pola Minnum,        Aadaiyina [A#] ale
Malai [A] Meni Yellam [Gm] Mooduthamma,        [A#] Naanathina [Dm] ale
[F] Pakkamaaga Vandha Pinnum,        [F] Vetkamaaguma..
Inge [Gbar] Paarvaiyodu [Gm] Paarvai Sera,        [A#] Thoodhu Vendu [Dm] maa
Dm] Maalai Allavaa Nalla [F] Neram Allavaa,        Innum [Dm] Vaanam Paartha [A] Bhoomi
Pola [A#] Vazhalagu [Dm] ma
